  vault:{chapter:'Chapter II · The Grey Choir',title:'The ledger of the lost',place:'Port Mercy · Rialto Backstage',image:'photo-1519608487953-e999c86e7455',caption:'Beneath the stage · The old vault',text:`<p>Behind the velvet curtain, an iron stairway descends beneath the stage. The ledger rests on a plinth inside a circle of salt. Its pages are filled with names, dates, and a single mark beside your own: <em>the unclaimed.</em></p><p>A voice rises from the shadows. “They told us you were gone for good.” A pale man steps into view, and behind him, the same terrified heartbeat starts running.</p>`,speaker:'ELIAS, OF THE GREY CHOIR',choices:[['A','Offer a bargain.','Find out who wrote your name.'],['B','Command him to stand down.','Your voice carries a strange weight.'],['C','Lunge for the ledger.','Take what you came for.']]},
  finale:{chapter:'Chapter III · All Debts Come Due',title:'The first choice is yours',place:'Port Mercy · The Rialto',image:'photo-1519608487953-e999c86e7455',caption:'Dawn is still a long way off',text:`<p>The ledger is warm in your hands. Every name in it is a life that slipped through the city's cracks—and a thread leading back to the one who made you. Elias watches, waiting. Somewhere above, the terrified heartbeat has gone quiet.</p><p>By dawn, someone will come asking what happened here. Your first night is almost over. Your real unlife is just beginning.</p>`,speaker:'',choices:[['A','Give the ledger to Mara.','Honor the bargain.'],['B','Keep it—and disappear.','No one owns your future.'],['C','Offer it to Elias in exchange for the truth.','Make a dangerous ally.']]}
